# armour/shared/pauldron_capelet2_l: the T2 short hooded mantle (capelet.2; D55, STYLE_P2 29.3), its left half.
# Soft cloth in the coat colour (cloth1) over both shoulders to the elbow, 18 px across facing D (1 px past the shoulder
# line each side), the hem dagged in 2 px square tabs (TANNER'S tabbed signature); facing R / L 2 px behind the back to
# the shoulder blades with the thrown-back hood a soft lump behind the nape, the front edge on the chest. Never a cape:
# it ends at the elbow and the shoulder blades. The roll round the neck is the neck piece `cowl`. Rides the lean and
# the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Regions: P the lit plane, N the shade, R the tabs. Shared by the man
# and the woman (D10). Written by BODY tools/mantle.py (envelope fix round 1); re-run it, never hand-edit.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron capelet.2
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

